  "dcterms:title": "Inn Ambush 83 Dynamis request fixtures to endpoint (slice 2 commit 3)",
  "dcterms:description": "TRANSITION CASE added 2026-08-15 (conformance-ladder discipline; sc.task.2026-07-29_0930 slice 2, dynamis per its register dispositions: fork 0016 ruled b + drop 1831 Q2 + drop 0017). Migrates the FIVE authority request fixtures - authored inputs, not journal - from dyn:AbilityCheck / dyn:Stealth testType values to the frozen-mapping targets declared at srd-rules (d20-test/ability-check, skills/stealth). NOT in this transition, by ruling: journal/world/session dyn: carriers (reseed liabilities), the contracts pair dyn: lines incl. consequenceDescription (execution consumer-patch rider), the srd-record rungs (legacy publication). RIDER for slice 3: the fixture used a SKILL IRI as a testType; the mapped value is the skill individual - whether the endpoint contract wants it as testType or as a separate skill key is the platform contract question, not decided here.",
